EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Opportunity.Title_Company_Attorney__c},


We look forward to working with you on this transaction! We will be touching base within {!Opportunity.Title_Company_Days_Allotted__c} business days to confirm title work has been received. Once title work is received please email a copy of the commitment to closings@reination.com. Let us know if anything additional is needed at this time, contact information and contract details provided below.


Opportunity Owner: {!Opportunity.OwnerId}
Total Purchase Cost: ${!Opportunity.Total_Purchase_Cost__c}
Assignment Fee: ${!Opportunity.Additional_Purchase_Costs__c}
Contract Closing Date: {!Opportunity.Contract_Closing_Date__c}
Earnest Money: ${!Opportunity.Earnest_Money__c}
Earnest Money Held At: {!Opportunity.Earnest_Money_Held_At__c}
Title Company Attorney: {!Opportunity.Title_Company_Attorney__c}
Closing Concessions: {!Opportunity.Closing_Concessions_Information__c}
Occupancy At Closing: {!Opportunity.Occupancy_At_Closing__c}


Thank you!


REI Nation
Deidre Sandifer
closings@reination.com
(901) 505-0825
